msgstr ""

#: manual/api/core.md:202
msgid "Returns $z^{-1} = \\bar z / (a^2 + b^2)$."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/core.md:209
msgid "It has the same unscaled formula and the same abort on a zero modulus as `Complex::div`."
msgstr ""

