msgid "Instance"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/core.md:269
msgid "[!WARNING] `Complex[T]` is a field only when $-1$ is not a square in `T`. That holds for the real-number types `Float` and `Double`, but not for `Complex[Double]`: in `Complex[Complex[Double]]` the non-zero value $1 + i\\,j$ (with $i$ the inner and $j$ the outer unit) has squared modulus $1 + i^2 = 0$, so `inv` aborts. The `Field` instance is still provided for every `T : Field`; see the [core design](../design/core.md#when-the-construction-is-a-field)."
msgstr ""

